        <qualifiedname>themis::sharding::WALApplierConfig::strict_mode</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= true</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Enforce fail-closed <ref refid="structthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_l_s_n" kindref="compound">LSN</ref> ordering. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When enabled, each applied entry must be either:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the immediate successor of the current replica <ref refid="structthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_l_s_n" kindref="compound">LSN</ref>, or</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a bootstrap replay of <computeroutput>0/0</computeroutput> when the replica is still at its initial position.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Duplicate, stale, and out-of-order entries are rejected. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
